					<![CDATA[
						 <p>There's a link to SCP-422 in this story, but it links to the 'new' instance of 422, rather than whatever the sentient sound (SCP-422-00201) actually is. I searched, but couldn't find the actual article for the 'neutralized' SCP-422-00201 or any other mention of 00201.</p> <p>Could someone please update the SCP-422 link?</p> <p>That aside, great story!</p> 
				 	]]>
